msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"Haven't you got any Golden Agu here? You know, the pork\r\n"
"that keeps being featured on TV?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"Hmm, I've never seen this \"Golden Agu\" myself. Even regular\r\n"
"agu pork is very hard to come by, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"Well, what perfect timing! Aren't you Riki-chan's little\r\n"
"friend?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "I'm Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-chan, that's right! How silly of me. I'm more of a\r\n"
"\"face person\" when it comes to remembering people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"So, Kiryu-chan, would you happen to know where they might be\r\n"
"selling some Golden Agu? I've been looking everywhere for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Hmm... Sorry, but I wouldn't know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Well, I figured, what with you being from Tokyo and all,\r\n"
"that you'd know more than most... But that's too bad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"If you do happen to come across a place that's selling\r\n"
"Golden Agu, promise you'll tell me first!"
msgstr ""

